#: accounts/templates/accounts/email/create_account_reminder.body.html
#, fuzzy, python-format
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "        <p>We've noticed that you've been a SuperCoop member for a month/week but haven't set up a Tapir account to sign up for your first shift.</p>\n"
#| "        <p>\n"
#| "            As a reminder, to sign up for your first shift (or indicate that you are eligible for an\n"
#| "            <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19v91mj2MAJTtrPLCw54VMS6qlaiJqBqUAuiC6z_AKpw/edit#heading=h.rjj2v2m92fqa\">exemption</a>),\n"
#| "            please visit the Member Office in our shop.\n"
#| "            There, an account will be set up for you on Tapir, our online shift management system, \n"
#| "            and you will be guided through the steps to select your shift and working group.\n"
#| "        </p>\n"
#| "        <p>\n"
#| "            For general questions about your membership, please contact the Member Office by email <a href=\"mailto:mitglied@supercoop.de\">(mitglied@supercoop.de)</a>\n"
#| "            or feel free to drop by and meet other SuperCoopies in person! Opening hours are:\n"
#| "            <ul>\n"
#| "                <li>Monday - Friday from 16:30 to 19:30</li>\n"
#| "                <li>Saturdays from 11:00 to 14:00</li>\n"
#| "            </ul>\n"
#| "        </p>\n"
#| "        <p>\n"
#| "            You can find our shop at %(coop_street)s, %(coop_place)s.\n"
#| "        </p>\n"
#| "        "
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>We've noticed that you've been a SuperCoop member for a month/week but haven't set up a Tapir account to sign\n"
"            up for your first shift.</p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            As a reminder, to sign up for your first shift (or indicate that you are eligible for an\n"
"            <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19v91mj2MAJTtrPLCw54VMS6qlaiJqBqUAuiC6z_AKpw/edit#heading=h.rjj2v2m92fqa\">exemption</a>),\n"
"            please visit the Member Office in our shop.\n"
"            There, an account will be set up for you on Tapir, our online shift management system,\n"
"            and you will be guided through the steps to select your shift and working group.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            For general questions about your membership, please contact the Member Office by email <a href=\"mailto:mitglied@supercoop.de\">(mitglied@supercoop.de)</a>\n"
"            or feel free to drop by and meet other SuperCoopies in person! Opening hours are:\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li>Monday - Friday from 16:30 to 19:30</li>\n"
"            <li>Saturdays from 11:00 to 14:00</li>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            You can find our shop at %(coop_street)s, %(coop_place)s.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        <p>wir haben festgestellt, dass du bereits seit einem Monat/einer Woche Mitglied bei SuperCoop bist, aber noch kein Tapir Konto eingerichtet hast, um dich für deine erste Schicht anzumelden.</p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Zur Erinnerung: Um dich für deine erste Schicht anzumelden (oder anzugeben, dass du für eine\n"
"            <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19v91mj2MAJTtrPLCw54VMS6qlaiJqBqUAuiC6z_AKpw/edit#heading=h.rjj2v2m92fqa\">Ausnahmeregelung</a> in Frage kommst),\n"
"            besuche bitte das Mitgliederbüro in unserem Laden.\n"
"            Dort wird ein Konto für dich auf Tapir, unserem Online-Schichtverwaltungssystem, \n"
"eingerichtet und du wirst durch die Schritte zur Auswahl deiner Schicht und Arbeitsgruppe geführt.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Bei allgemeinen Fragen zu deiner Mitgliedschaft wende dich bitte an das Mitgliederbüro per E-Mail <a href=\"mailto:mitglied@supercoop.de“>(mitglied@supercoop.de)</a>\n"
"            oder besuche <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/SuperCoop+Berlin/@52.553371,13.3585897,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x72e80db955fa8d3!8m2!3d52.5533091!4d13.3586012\">SuperCoop</a>.\n"
"            Komm gerne vorbei und lerne andere SuperCoopies persönlich kennen! Die Öffnungszeiten sind:\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li>Montag - Freitag von 16:30 - 19:30 Uhr</li>\n"
"             <li>Samstags von 11.00 - 14.00 Uhr</li>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Unseren Laden findest du in der %(coop_street)s, %(coop_place)s. \n"
"        </p>\n"
"    "

