#: statistics/templates/statistics/main_statistics.html
msgid "Here you can follow the progress of the funding campaign. Both additional shares (all shares that are subscribed to over and above the compulsory share) and subordinated loans are counted. The period runs from 12.09.2023 - 09.12.2023. What one person can't achieve, many can!"
